Description: NFTBAN - Enterprise firewall management engine for Linux
 NFTBAN is an enterprise-grade firewall management engine built on Linux nftables.
 It replaces legacy firewall scripts with a modern architecture featuring atomic
 rule updates, strict privilege separation via Polkit, and AI-assisted threat
 intelligence to create a resilient, self-healing network defense layer.
 .
 The name NFTBAN (NFTables BAN actions) emphasizes its foundation on native
 nftables technology for high-performance, kernel-level packet filtering.
 .
 Key features:
  - Atomic rule updates without connection disruption
  - Granular privilege separation through Polkit
  - Real-time threat intelligence integration
  - Geographic blocking with GeoIP automation
  - Port scan and DDoS detection at kernel level
  - Hosting panel integration (DirectAdmin, cPanel, etc.)
  - Modern CLI + optional Web GUI
  - Prometheus/Grafana observability
